<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/52/eng@/~cl_7__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(3) For the purposes of this section— (a) \"entitled persons\" means persons who have been allocated securities by an offeror in an offer for sale; and (b) \"offeror\", in relation to any security, means the owner of the security.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/52/eng@> .
