<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/52/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/name> "Part III of the principal Act is amended by"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/52/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/52/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "inserting after section 41 the following section: 4lA. No notice of any trust, expressed, implied or constructive, shall be receivable by the central depository and the central depository or anything done by the central depository in relation to deposited securities shall not be affected by notice of any such trust.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/52/eng@> .
